  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kubatana Trust of Zimbabwe is an organisation that works with         collecting and spreading information on different topics, including   government data and decision making. Sida supports a project during   2012-2014 titled Liberating Voices and Open Data Initiative. Strategy for special contributions for democratisation and freedom of          expression 2012-2014.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kubatana Trust of Zimbabwe &#xe4;r en organisation som arbetar med att     samla in och sprida information i Zimbabwe genom web, sms,            informationsblad och andra kommunikationskanaler. Sida st&#xf6;der ett     projekt 2012-2014 utvalt genom utlysning via strategin f&#xf6;r s&#xe4;rskilda  insatser f&#xf6;r demokratisering och yttrandefrihet.</narrative>
